 pope positioned near the altar, Napoleon proceeds to crown his then wife, Joséphine de Beauharnais as Empress.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJacques-Louis_David_-_The_Coronation_of_Napoleon_(1805-1807).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Jean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_%28MNBA%29.jpg/500px-Jean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_%28MNBA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Jean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_%28MNBA%29.jpg/1280px-Jean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_%28MNBA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Jean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_%28MNBA%29.jpg/500px-Jean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_%28MNBA%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"John VI, King of Portugal and the Algarves, Emperor of Brazil","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJean-Baptiste_Debret_-_Retrato_de_Dom_Jo%C3%A3o_VI_(MNBA).jpg"}],"sounds":{"emperor":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/En-us-emperor.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c9/En-us-emperor.ogg/En-us-emperor.ogg.mp3"}],"jewel":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/En-us-jewel.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c6/En-us-jewel.ogg/En-us-jewel.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Silhouette of an island at dusk with purple sky and clouds in Don Det Si Phan Don Lao